    <<link "Check under the deck<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You tiptoe across the yard, scanning for any sign of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> without giving your location away. You figure he won’t have eyes on you, but if he hears you coming he may just make a break for it before you can spot him. The kid is pretty fast and you wouldn’t put it past him to run circles around you without you even knowing. <span style="Color: Yellow">You hear his giggles echo faintly, the sound coming from the deck.</span> <br>
        <br>
        Then you spot it, crouching down you see the familiar color of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>’s sneakers poking out from just beneath the wooden planks. Got him-! <br>
        <br>
        <<if _kaydenLocation == 1>>
            <span style="Color: LightGreen">You reach out and grab the boy by his ankles!</span> He screams, terror mixed with laughter as you drag him out and lift him into the air by his ankles. <span style="Color: Pink">His shirt flutters up, revealing his adorable little belly and the waistband of his blue briefs, pulled up just enough to give you a good peek.</span> <br>
            
