            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“How did you find me!?”</span> He says as his giggles stop, pushing his shirt out of his face. You explain to him the error in his plan, his brightly colored shoes weren’t covered at all and gave his hiding spot away. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> turns a bit red and puffs out his cheeks, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No fair!”</span> He crosses his arms, pretending to pout. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just you wait! Next time you’ll never find me!”</span> <br>
            <br>
            That may be true, but this time you did find him, meaning you should get a reward. And seeing as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>’s little sides are completely exposed to you and he is helplessly in your grasp, you know just what your prize should be! <span style="Color: Pink">You begin to tickle <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> relentlessly, the young boy defenseless to your attack as he is laughing until tears are rolling down his cheeks. A fitting reward indeed.</span> <br>
            <br>
