        <<else>>
            You reach out to grab his ankles – <span style="Color: Yellow">only to find no sign of the boy, just his empty shoes places strategically under the deck.</span> The little twerp actually got one over on you. You laugh and praise his trick out loud, trying to bait him out with praise, but he shows no sign of appearing. You continue your search. <br>
            <br>
            <<if $Player.Kinks.Kids == 1>>
                As you search, you briefly wonder if you could get <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> to try that trick with something a bit more substantial than his sneakers. <span style="Color: Pink">You imagine what it would have been like had he used his bottoms as bait, snickering about how clever his trick is as he runs off to his real hiding space with his underwear-clad butt on full display. You blush at the thought.</span> <br>
                <br>
            <</if>>
