        The backyard is quiet, too quiet. Not even a distant giggle or breathing of the lad. He truly is a master of this game, but unlucky for him, you are far beyond that of a master. You near the pool shed, circling it and scanning the bushes and sides carefully. You imagine him just out of sight, circling around with you in a humorous merry-go-round. <br>
